BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mealtime Environments and Feeding Relationships With Toronto Publi
 c Health
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261211T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261211T123000
UID:6acffc4b9dbc2b002c8ea9d4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us after Baby Time for a workshop led by a Toronto Publi
 c Health Community Nutrition Educator to discuss healthy feeding environme
 nts and feeding behaviours. Common challenges for feeding toddlers and pre
 schoolers\, how to allow children to follow their hunger cues\, and involv
 ing children in food skills will be discussed.\nNo registration required.\
 nFor parents and caregivers of children 0-5.
LOCATION:Bloor/Gladstone
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6acffc4b9dbc2b002c8ea9d4
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
