BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Makers in Motion !
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261209T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261209T113000
UID:6ae25c8af9d28050ccaf7e75@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Spark Big Creativity in Little Hands!\nJoin us every Wednesday
  morning for a hands-on\, process-focused craft adventure designed specifi
 cally for toddlers and preschoolers (ages 18 months –5years). From sens
 ory textures and squishy paints to simple cut-and-paste fun\, your little 
 maker will explore\, experiment\, and express themselves in a welcoming\, 
 low-pressure environment. It’s the perfect midweek routine to boost fine
  motor skills\, inspire curiosity\, and leave the mess with us! (Grown-up 
 participation required). Drop in.
LOCATION:Port Union\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae25c8af9d28050ccaf7e75
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
