BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:PA Day Movie: How to Train Your Dragon (2025)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T143000
UID:6ab00eda86d8450031177c5d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us this PA Day for the movie\nHow to Train Your Dragon\n(
 \n2025\n) at the ACD Library Auditorium. It is an excellent\, fun\, and e
 ntertaining movie.\nAs an ancient threat endangers both Vikings and dragon
 s alike on the isle of Berk\, the friendship between Hiccup\, an inventive
  Viking\, and Toothless\, a Night Fury dragon\, becomes the key to both sp
 ecies forging a new future together.\nOpen to children of all ages and th
 eir parents or caregivers.\nThe movie is based on the book\nHow to Train 
 Your Dragon by Cressida Cowell\n. If you want to read the book\, click on
  the link.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab00eda86d8450031177c5d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
