BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Classical & Latin American Guitar Performance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261208T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261208T193000
UID:6ac5874da85a2c00337db3b3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Karla García is a Chilean-Canadian guitarist\, music creator\
 , and educator based in Toronto. Originally from Chiloé\, Chile\, she ha
 s performed as a soloist and collaborator with orchestras and ensembles in
  Canada and Latin America. Her musical work brings together classical guit
 ar\, Latin American music\, popular music\, and original songs. Karla stud
 ied guitar at the University of Chile and has performed with orchestras in
 cluding the Ontario Pops Orchestra and the Scarborough Philharmonic Orches
 tra. As an educator\, she is passionate about creating welcoming and engag
 ing learning experiences that help students develop confidence and a lasti
 ng connection with music.\nNo registration required\, all are welcome\n!
LOCATION:Mimico Centennial
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac5874da85a2c00337db3b3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
