BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Movies - A PAW Patrol Christmas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261212T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261212T130000
UID:6abff50111bbf300684acae3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every other Saturday Cliffcrest will be screening a free famil
 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nA PAW Patrol Christmas\nRubble can
 't wait for Christmas to come this year as he's especially looking forward
  to Santa bringing him a Lazer Drill. But when all of Adventure Bay\, incl
 uding Mayor Humdinger\, learn that Santa has come down with a cold and Chr
 istmas is cancelled\, Mayor Humdinger decides he's going to go to the Nort
 h Pole and take all of the gifts for himself. Rubble\, keen on getting tha
 t drill\, falls for a lie from Mayor Humdinger and inadvertently helps him
  on his mission. It will take all the Paw Patrol and Rubble making a sacri
 fice to stop Mayor Humdinger from ruining Christmas and learning the true 
 meaning of the season.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abff50111bbf300684acae3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
