BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Saturday Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261031T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261031T120000
UID:6ac4302ee06996003a81932a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Hip Hip Hooray!  Our children's department is delighted to in
 troduce our brand new Saturday Storytimes! Start your reading journey righ
 t\, with a librarian led story session\, including reading\, singing\, rhy
 mes and maybe even a little dance. After the stories are over\, join us fo
 r some stay and play where you can meet and play with other families in y
 our community. This program is intended for ages 0-5 but all are welcome. 
 Storytime runs from\n11 am\nto\n11:30 am\nand then\nchildren\, parents and
  caregivers are invited to Stay and Play\nuntil 12 pm\n.\nDrop-in. Space 
 is Limited
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, Children's Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac4302ee06996003a81932a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
