UID:6ab3f792129d8e0031f47c47@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a special\, relatively spooky\, Saturday mor
 ning Costume Party & Storytime featuring some of the usual songs\, stories
 \, and rhymes in addition to a few Halloween-themed activities in this pro
 gram for children ages\n0-12\nand their parents or caregivers. This specia
 l Storytime will run from\n10:30 to 11am.\nHowever\, children\, parents
 \, and caregivers are invited to stay\, play\, and participate in a\nC\nos
 tume Contest\nand other Halloween fun between\n11am\nto\n12pm\n.\nCostum
 es are non-mandatory\, but are encouraged!\nDrop-in program. No registrati
 on required.\nPlease note that Halloween candy/chocolates will be availabl
 e for participants.\nIf you or your child lives with a disability\, and re
 quires an accessibility accommodation to participate in this program\, ple
 ase contact Accessibility Service by email\naccessibleservices@tpl.ca\nor 
 voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, to make a request. Please contact at least thre
 e weeks in advance.
