BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Saturday at the Movies: Nightmare Before Christmas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261128T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261128T160000
UID:6adcd33ba85a2c003381d8aa@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us to watch: Nightmare Before Christmas.  What's this...
  What's this... Hallowe'en's been cancelled?  Santa Claus is missing?  J
 ust what mischief has Jack Skellington caused this time.  Join us for thi
 s month's Saturday at the Movies and find out!  We'll hand out a movie pa
 ssport to keep your ticket in and track the films you come see.
LOCATION:Elmbrook Park\, program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adcd33ba85a2c003381d8aa
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nostalgic Family Movie Night: The Muppet Christmas Carol
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261211T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261211T200000
UID:6ae246b08389bd86bfa3ba3a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get into the holiday spirit with a cozy\, nostalgic Christmas 
 movie night at the library! Bring your family\, get comfy in your favorite
  pajamas\, slippers\, blankets\, and pillows\, and enjoy a festive evening
  filled with movie magic\, laughter\, and holiday cheer.\nBring Your Favor
 ite Drink!\nFeel free to bring your own hot chocolate or favorite beverage
  to sip while you watch.\nCome cozy!\nPajamas\, slippers\, and comfy cloth
 es are highly encouraged!\nSnacks Are on Us!\nThe library will provide del
 icious snacks to make your movie night extra special.\nIngredient lists wi
 ll be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nL
 et’s make some cozy holiday memories together!
LOCATION:Pape/Danforth\, 2nd Floor\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae246b08389bd86bfa3ba3a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
