BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Explore Musical Instruments: Open House
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T153000
UID:6ae396a3f9d28050ccafb5b5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Downsview is partnering with Community Music Schools of Toront
 o for an Instrument Open House.\nJoin us this PA Day for this fun and enga
 ging opportunity for drop-in participants of all ages to play\, experience
 \, and learn about a variety of musical instruments. Expert instructors wi
 ll be on hand to assist\, demonstrate\, and answer questions.\nChildren un
 der 9 years old must be accompanied by their parents or guardians.\nCommun
 ity Music Schools of Toronto is a registered charity that gives children a
 nd youth a rich and rewarding music and social education\, by removing the
  financial obstacle. For 27 years we have seen that the study of music all
 ows young people to flourish creatively\, personally and academically...en
 riching their lives and future prospects. Our students have access to some
  of Toronto’s best music teachers and a vast array of musical instrument
 s and options.\nDrop in. No registration required.
LOCATION:Downsview\, Children's Area\, Main Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae396a3f9d28050ccafb5b5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
